    "Scanning %@ through a router, which hides MAC addresses and Bonjour. Names come from the router; scan once while connected to this network to identify vendors and types." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "跨路由扫描 %@：隔着路由器拿不到 MAC 和 Bonjour 信息，名称向路由器查询；直连该网络扫描一次即可识别厂商与类型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scanning %@ through a router, which hides MAC addresses and Bonjour. Vendors and models are from the last scan on this network; names come from the router." : {
